1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,610
Almost everyone in this town lives in one building.

2
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:06,550
And the only road into town closes every night.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,780
This is Whittier, Alaska, about 60 road miles from Anchorage.

4
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,230
Mountains surround it on three sides.

5
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:17,720
On the fourth is Prince William Sound.

6
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:24,290
Almost all of its roughly 275 people live here, in Begich Towers.

7
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:28,370
14 floors. 196 apartments.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,650
To drive in, you take a tunnel.

9
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:33,610
2.5 miles long, one lane, shared with trains.

10
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,220
Cars and trains take turns.

11
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,990
And at night, it closes. The only way in closes at night.
